  "displayDescription": {
    "en": "Configurable FBSir AI decision-review team: frame the decision, convene only the necessary seats, surface dissent and deliver a traceable action memo.",
    "zh": "福帮手经营决策独立审议专家团｜按案组建必要席位，独立判断、交叉质询、保留异议，交付可追溯行动备忘录"
  },
  "avatar": "avatars/team.png",
  "categoryId": "12-IndustryConsultant",
  "defaultInitPrompt": {
    "zh": "我正在面对一个重要经营决策。请先给我一张紧凑决策起手卡，最多问 2 个决定性问题；末尾只给主动作“按建议开始独立审议”和次级分支“补充关键事实”“切换审议模式”。在我明确确认前不要写案卷，也不要建团。",
    "en": "I am facing an important business decision. Start with a compact decision card and ask up to two decision-changing questions. End with one primary action and two secondary branches. Do not create a team before my explicit confirmation."
  },
