  "quickPrompts": [
    {
      "en": "I am facing an important business decision. Start with a compact decision card and ask up to two decision-changing questions. End with one primary action and two secondary branches. Do not create a team before my explicit confirmation.",
      "zh": "我正在面对一个重要经营决策。请先给我一张紧凑决策起手卡，最多问 2 个决定性问题；末尾只给主动作“按建议开始独立审议”和次级分支“补充关键事实”“切换审议模式”。在我明确确认前不要写案卷，也不要建团。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Start with a compact decision card for this M&A or investment decision. Ask up to two decision-changing questions, select up to three relevant specialist seats, preserve dissent, and show the same one primary action and two secondary branches. Do not create a team before my explicit confirmation.",
      "zh": "为这个并购或投资决策起手卡，问2个决定性问题，从战略、资本财务、法务和整合候选中选3个改变结论的专业席保留异议；只显示“按建议开始独立审议”“补充关键事实”“切换审议模式”，确认前不写案卷不建团。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Our growth has stalled. Start with a compact decision card comparing a deeper core business, channel change and a reversible second-curve test. Ask up to two decision-changing questions and show the same one primary action and two secondary branches. Do not create a team before my explicit confirmation.",
      "zh": "公司增长停滞了，请先形成紧凑决策起手卡，比较深挖主业、变革渠道和可逆的小试第二曲线，最多问 2 个决定性问题；仍只显示“按建议开始独立审议”“补充关键事实”“切换审议模式”，确认前不要写案卷不建团。"
    }
  ],
